<title>FINLAND: Finnish June jobless rate up to 16.5 pct - ministry.</title>
<headline>Finnish June jobless rate up to 16.5 pct - ministry.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland's jobless rate rose to 16.5 percent in June from 15.5 percent in May, the Labour Ministry said in its monthly employment survey on Wednesday.</p>
<p>			June 1997	 May 1997     June 1996</p>
<p> Unemployed	   420,536	  394,578	 459,166</p>
<p> Jobless rate (pct)  16.5	     15.5	    18.0</p>
<p>Six economists' average forecast for the June jobless rate measured by the labour ministry was 16.5 percent (range 16.3 -16.5 pct) The ministry's data is not used in international comparisons.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
